{"title":"The Incredible Forum","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/community/c3101657\">The Incredible Forum</a> is an AoPS game forum founded by <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/index.php/User:Megahertz13\">megahertz13</a> on August 12, 2022. It has reached up to 1st on the <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/community/c9_other_forums\">Other Forums</a>, being one of the most active forums for around a year and a half, falling into inactivity in the first half of 2024 before making a return. Joining megahertz13 in administration are <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/index.php/User:Sotowa\">Sotowa</a> and <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/index.php/User:k1glaucus\">k1glaucus</a>. Its moderators are <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/index.php/User:EthanSpoon\">EthanSpoon</a>, <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/index.php/User:lucaswujc\">lucaswujc</a>, <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/index.php/User:Aminecraftbear\">Aminecraftbear</a>, and <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/index.php/User:dragonlouis\">dragonlouis</a>. Other notable contributors include former moderators <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/index.php/User:Cothoop\">cothoop</a>, \n<a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/index.php/Bob_Smart\">Bob_Smart</a>, <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/index.php/User:Desertsnow\">Desertsnow</a>, <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/index.php/User:delicatehunter\">delicatehunter</a>, <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/index.php/User:BlueGecko\">BlueGecko</a>, <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/index.php/User:mynameisJEJ\">mynameisJEJ</a>, <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/index.php/User:Speedcuber7\">SpeedCuber7</a>, and game makers <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/index.php/User:PatTheKing806\">PatTheKing806</a> and <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/index.php/User:ryanbear\">ryanbear</a>. More data can be found in <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/community/c3101657h2928835_data_center\">the Data Center</a>.\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\">\n<caption>Names\n</caption>\n<tbody><tr>\n<th>Forum Name</th>\n<th>Time Periods</th>\n<th>More info\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Math Puzzles &amp; Games</td>\n<td>Aug 12, 2022 - Sept 1, 2022</td>\n<td>This is the original name and the namesake of MPG\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Math, Puzzles, and Games</td>\n<td>Sept 1, 2022 - Sept 9, 2022</td>\n<td>Suggestion by MrMustache to fix the grammar (and noted by zlrara01)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>The Incredible Forum</td>\n<td>Sept 9, 2022 - Nov 20, 2022; Nov 28, 2022 - May 1, 2023; May 1, 2023 - present</td>\n<td><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/community/c3101657h2967647_forum_name_voting\">Voted back for branding</a> after it was changed. Changed back to TIF after <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/index.php/User:Megahertz13\">megahertz13</a> changed to TI-36\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>High-Quality Games and Fun</td>\n<td>Nov 20, 2022 - Nov 28, 2022</td>\n<td>Not to be confused with <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/community/c898035_high_quality_fun_amp_games\">High-Quality Fun &amp; Games</a>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>TI-36</td>\n<td>May 1, 2023</td>\n<td>Changed and reverted soon after, leading to a vote on the name of the forum\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p>There are also rumors about some sort of group under the name of the Coalition Under Lovers of Trees lurking around that wants to steal your MPG...\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/4/2/d42b8f2f55279064f67928eddcc73b6f4d67cf28.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\phantom{the culT Shall enJoy its revenge}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"243\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261018111951\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.010 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.017 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 4/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 0/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 2/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 213/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    0.000      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:23314:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261018111951 and revision id 227456. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}